ed to  by the Malayan government he could have  stopped what he was doing at some point  but I have to admit that now after  seeing Reiner in this horrible position  where he knows that no matter what he  does there will be more suffering and  more  tragedy I have to feel for him just a  little bit out in the plaza we see the  jaw tighten beast tighten and peak  scarred Titan battling against the  scouts and they're all being extremely  careful of Levi or as they call him the  Ackerman meanwhile in the showdown  between Aaron's attack Titan and the  warhammer Titan Eren attempts to eat  through the crystal in which Willie's  sister is hiding but he is unable to and  his teeth break Eren mentions that the  crystal is just as hard as Annie's and  this to me confirms that Annie is still  alive if Aaron needs to get through the  crystal to eat the shifter and he cannot  break through it then he couldn't have  eaten annie annie has to be still alive  Aaron tells the Tiber sister that he  still has a trick up his sleeve and he  emerges from the titan body and right  away creates another one this is now the  third time that Aaron has created a  Titan in only a few minutes so we can  definitely say that he has done an  insane amount of training during the  four-year time skin Porco and Peake are  talking about the battle and Porco  believes that they have the upper hand  because they have control of the  battlefield and reinforcements are on  the way and by the way it's crazy how  clearly Peake can communicate in her  Titan form but anyway Peake says that  they have to protect Zeke from the  Ackermann and then classic Zeke fashion  he says as expected of peak that's  exactly right let me know in the  comments if you guys love these peak  memes Zeke then proceeds to use what  looks like some weird fur attack where  he appears to be throwing his fur at the  scouts not sure exactly what this is all  about and then he says something really  interesting  he says Eren Jaeger is not my enemy this  is what we've been talking about for the  past few chapters what is Zeke's real  plan is he actually cooperating with  Aaron just remember that at this point  everyone thinks that Aaron is this  horrible villain just look at how Gabby  considers Aaron to be the worst person  ever and yet at this moment  Zeke still says that Aaron is not his  enemy this to me is more than just some  throwaway sentence and then Zeke says  come out Levi time is running out you  know and at that same moment Levi  appears to be looking at a  pocketwatch then we see a scene where  the Marlon military is gathering at a  port or a harbor and they're getting  ready to send soldiers to a burial as  backup they see what at first looks like  a scared little blonde girl on a fishing  boat and they tell her to get out of  there because it's too dangerous  and that a massive explosion is seen as  the little girl turns out to be Armand  who uses the colossal Titans power to  blow up the entire Marlay and military  Armada before they can reach labarie oh  so much for reinforcements and Arman's  deceptive cross-play strikes again don't  forget that back in the uprising saga  Armand was the one who pretended to be  historia in order to trick the  government when they realize what just  happened mag ass tries to get Gabby and  Falco to get away and meanwhile Porco  loses it and tries to go after Aaron  because he believes that if he can just  take the founding titan then the battle  will be over  even without reinforcements however  Mikasa another Ackerman is there to  protect  Aaron meanwhile the scouts say it's  almost time already and they decide to  take out the machine guns on the cart  Titan by any means necessary  remember how Zeke said to Levi time is  running out you know and then Levi looks  at his pocket watch and now the scouts  say it's almost time and then in the  very next moment Levi strikes the nape  of the Beast Titan and seemingly kills  him the Beast titan falls to the ground  lifeless and the Marlins are shocked  just to make sure that he finishes the  job in the coolest way possible Levi  throws a hand grenade into the cut that  he made on Zeke Snape and Zeke is  seemingly killed and killed bad next the  scouts go after Pete as Sasha Snipes one  of the Gunners on the cart Titan and  soon after the others are Thunder  speared into oblivion by Jeanne the cart  titan collapses its armor destroyed  peaks titan looks to be completely  immobilized and Jean moves in for the  kill but then falco gets in the way and  begs for Jeanne to stop the chapter ends  with the words there's no stopping this  chain of tragedies with an exclamation  mark and a question mark and truly this  is the fundamental question this  chain of tragedies which began way back  during the LDN Empire and which led to  the great titan war and to the attack on  the island and now to the counter  attacked on Marlay continues to claim  innocent lives it doesn't matter who  started it it doesn't matter who is  right because in the end innocent people  continue to suffer on all sides I was  actually born in the former Yugoslavia  right around the outbreak of a major  civil war there back in the 90s and if  you ask the different sides involved  even today they will tell you that the  other guys started it and that it was  the fault of the other side but the fact  is that innocent people suffered on all  sides this is the true nature of war  I've always felt that the Ghibli film  grave of the fireflies was the best  representation of the suffering that  civilians go through in war but attack  on Titan is quickly becoming one of the  best and most complex stories about the  nature of war really an amazing job by  Yama there are two things that I will  say at this point I am afraid that gene  might die in the next chapter the reason  I say this is because I think he will  probably stop himself from attacking  peak in order to spare Falco who is  still just a boy but then Gaby will take  advantage of genes hesitation and use  the gun that she has been carrying  around with her to shoot him I don't  want this to happen but I definitely see  this happening the second thing that I  want to say is that I'm going out on a  limb here and I might look stupid later  but I believe that Zeek is on air inside  and I believe that he is still alive  Levi's attack on the Beast Titan was  planned that is why Zeek said time is  running out just as Levi looks at his  watch and that is why the Scout said  it's almost time right before Levi's  made his move Zeke has been in touch  with Aaron Zeke tried to make sure that  peak and Porco would be sent into the  underground trap  Zeke wanted Reiner to meet with Aaron  Zeke openly says that Aaron is not his  enemy at a time when everyone in Marlay  sees Aaron as literally the devil and I  believe that Zeke made it look like he  was killed by Levi but in reality he  somehow made it out alive and he is on  this  of the scouts this is my prediction and  if I'm wrong I will take the L let me  know if you agree or do you think that  I'm going to look stupid in the next  chapter for saying this also let me know  if you think that a major death is  coming possibly the death of Jean at the  hands of Gabby or do you think that a  major death already happened and Zeke  really is dead if you enjoyed the attack  on titan content on this channel be sure  to leave a like to let me know if you're  new to the channel don't forget to  subscribe and hit that notification bell  and we are now posting daily content on  twitter and instagram so be sure to  follow us at anime uproar by the way we  have been trying to showcase some of the  fan art and artwork by members of the  anime opera community so if you're an  artist and you would like to have your  work featured in one of our videos and  on our social media be sure to hit us up  on Twitter and Instagram if it's attack  on Titan fan art then of course we can  feature it 